# Artifacts that carry a live value legitimately, one per line: the file, two spaces, the value, two
# spaces, and why. Anything not recorded here fails generation.
#
# **The file is its repository-relative path, exactly (H-25 review, H3).** A bare file name was
# accepted too, and one entry for `(X.json, value)` then exempted that value in every other `X.json`
# anywhere in the scanned surface. Both the generators and the tree walk now key by the artifact's
# destination in the repository, so one spelling is enough and it is the specific one.
#
# The distinction the rule draws: an artifact whose *subject* is the announced deployment may name it;
# an artifact that merely looks more concrete for carrying one may not.

vectors/V-P-12.json  By5XeTsCS4Qf17U9EuGUTzEFz29wQdFFeqJtfhnFQkZB  §2.4's derivation is checked against this deployment, which is the vector's whole subject
vectors/V-P-12.json  0xa2f283cb90ea20af164f791073b89f5f22f59081f8509f664721ec57df9fb7ee  the same program id, as the bytes the derivation hashes
vectors/V-P-12.json  CZM6LnvAX2D7FGbGwfWMCTG9rRhgzX3JjZQxTjNvRYz7  the address §2.4 publishes and the derivation must reproduce
vectors/V-P-12.json  0xabb9dc3b417c0d0fe2b99d109e5d1b0b8b71c7e693c20e756cabdf7e6d30d6fc  the same address, as bytes
vectors/V-P-12.json  H3ERVV7P3yNQxXXJrzVvmS2Nzh9qBd283kcAgMHzHDNn  the two-seed case, answered for by the cluster, which is the check
vectors/V-P-12.json  0xee4d543bd97a4e39c47cf3e12e017b329fe9d1b5bd0ee7bb9942f98206bb612f  the same address, as the bytes the vector carries
ts/test/units.test.ts  By5XeTsCS4Qf17U9EuGUTzEFz29wQdFFeqJtfhnFQkZB  §2.4's derivation checked against the announced deployment, which is this test's subject (H-25)
ts/test/units.test.ts  CZM6LnvAX2D7FGbGwfWMCTG9rRhgzX3JjZQxTjNvRYz7  the address that derivation must reproduce, and the reason the test is worth running (H-25)
